{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24439","headline":"九月八日酬皇甫十见赠 · 白居易","name":"九月八日酬皇甫十见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君方对酒缀诗章，我正持斋坐道场。\n处处追游虽不去，时时吟咏亦无妨。\n霜蓬旧鬓三分白，露菊新花一半黄。\n惆怅东篱不同醉，陶家明日是重阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}